OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin dry with
OL,6,Fsunny spells. Cloud will soon build
OL,7,Fbringing a few showers. These showers
OL,8,Fwill clear during the afternoon. Light
OL,9,Frain and drizzle will spread to the
OL,10,FWestern Isles from late afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAfter a dry start east before
OL,13,Fcloud and outbreaks of light rain or
OL,14,Fdrizzle push in from the west. This
OL,15,Fwill become heavy at times in the
OL,16,Fnorthwest towards morning.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FA few bright spells north at
OL,19,Ffirst otherwise cloudy with outbreaks
OL,20,Fof rain, heavy at times in the west,
OL,21,Fspreading east in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
